{"ID":"20240513083447-8wl3sma","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083447-8wl3sma","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083447-8wl3sma\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513095643-0j1gvk2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513095643-0j1gvk2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:677,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513095643-0j1gvk2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:610,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:610\u0026#125;","title":"012","type":"doc","updated":"20240515124736"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513095643-0j1gvk2","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 1152px;","id":"20240513095643-0j1gvk2","updated":"20240515124736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"      初診日期：2008/3/21"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"003-1 B,YR"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"72歲  身材中等"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/3/21"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"飯後氣逆，嗳氣才覺舒適已十年。喝完水也會嗝氣上來。無嘔酸。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小便頻尿時血尿(痛)，倪師問：「當你尿痛時你覺得是前面膀胱痛或是後面腎區骨盆區痛?」答：「前面膀胱少腹痛」(倪師曰：「血尿會痛比不痛好，血尿又不痛的很多是癌症。」)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右膝關節有時會痛，左膝不痛。後腰脊椎因蹲下而骨折。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"臉部左側撞傷後，右臉無汗，右半身汗亦少。病人自訴服多種維他命許多年，服用骨質疏鬆藥三年。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"54歲停經。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診：\n1、睡眠："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不深。只能睡2~4個小時，然後就半夢半醒"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、胃口："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3、大便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每日行，不易出，出則硬塊(若吃抗生素治尿血則便秘加重)。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4、小便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"頻尿且尿血會痛。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5、口渴："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有，溫飲。晚上口乾。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6、手足溫度："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙足溫。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7、其他："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"短期記憶力差(腎!)。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腎脈重按則無，表示沒有實證。如果重按仍有乃是實證"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"外圍一圈色紅無苔，中央淡黃濕。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脾區過小，右眼腎區變形，心包有痰濕。瞳孔對光反應尚可。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右耳腎區壓痛。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右腎變形、腎家寒濕、骨傷、尺脈無力。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 旋覆花三錢 代赭石三錢 厚朴二錢 乾薑二錢 吳茱萸二錢  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"細辛二錢 烏藥四錢  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"豬苓三錢 滑石五錢 茯苓五錢 澤瀉五錢 阿膠三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→豬苓湯 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"補骨脂三錢 牡蠣一兩"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→補腎補鈣補骨質"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五付 九碗水煮三碗 早晚飯前"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、HT-89健筋骨丸 六兩    30X2  午飯與睡覺前"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}